# Mobile (tourism-mobile)

- Feature-first: `application` / `domain` / `data` / `presentation`.
- Widgets do not call Dio; use Riverpod providers + repository interfaces.
- Freezed/json_serializable/build_runner are Phase 5 — do not add until that phase.
- Prefer const widgets; handle loading/error/empty/success for async screens.
- After `await`, respect mounted / BuildContext safety.
- Dependencies via `flutter pub add`; commit `pubspec.lock`.
- Style: `tourism-platform/docs/flutter-code-style.md`.
- After changes: `./scripts/validate.sh` or `make mobile-check` (`analyze --fatal-infos`).
